<view class="page login"><view class="logo">食</view><view class="title">小食叙记</view><view class="intro">用微信登录，开始记录你的每一顿饭。</view><button class="primary-btn" loading="{{loading}}" bindtap="login">微信一键登录</button><view class="privacy">登录即表示你同意我们的隐私说明</view><view wx:if="{{profileOpen}}" class="profile-mask"><view class="profile-panel"><view class="eyebrow">YOUR FOOD IDENTITY</view><view class="profile-title">给自己取个小食昵称</view><view class="muted">它只会在小食叙记中展示，不读取微信昵称和头像。</view><input class="nickname-input" maxlength="16" placeholder="例如：爱吃面的同学" value="{{nickname}}" bindinput="input"/><view class="avatar-title">选一个匿名小印章</view><view class="avatar-grid"><view wx:for="{{avatars}}" wx:key="id" class="avatar-choice {{avatarId === item.id ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="chooseAvatar">{{item.label}}</view></view><button class="primary-btn" loading="{{saving}}" bindtap="saveProfile">保存小食身份</button><view class="skip" bindtap="skipProfile">暂时使用默认昵称</view></view></view></view>
